# Needs the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client). Click "Send Request" above each ### block, in order.
@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Is the API alive? (expect "Healthy")
GET {{host}}/health

### 2. Create a test account and tokens (Development only)
# @name seed
POST {{host}}/dev/seed?balance=100000

###
@token = {{seed.response.body.$.opsToken}}
@account = {{seed.response.body.$.accountId}}

### 3. Make a payment (a new Idempotency-Key each time you click)
# @name pay
POST {{host}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountId": "{{account}}", "amount": 250.00, "currency": "INR", "merchantId": "shop-1" }

###
@txid = {{pay.response.body.$.transactionId}}

### 4. Check the payment. Click a few times: Hybrid mode may go PendingRisk, then Settled
GET {{host}}/api/payments/{{txid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Same Idempotency-Key twice returns the SAME payment, never a second charge
POST {{host}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: my-fixed-key-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountId": "{{account}}", "amount": 99.00, "currency": "INR", "merchantId": "shop-2" }

### 6. What did the AI agents and rules decide? (audit trail)
GET {{host}}/api/ops/audit/{{txid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. The run logs (the same data the app's Run logs screen shows)
GET {{host}}/api/ops/logs?take=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Error summary for the last 24 hours
GET {{host}}/api/ops/logs/summary?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
